spans.s:
नि-गाल, अस्, m. the throat or neck of a horse;
[cf. गल, नि-गरण.]
—निगाल-वत्, आन्, m. a horse.

नि-गरण, अम्, n. swallowing, devouring, deglu-
tition; (अस्), m. the throat, the gullet, esophagus;
the smoke of a burnt offering; [cf. नि-गण.]

नि-ग्रहण, अस्, आ, अम्, holding down, holding
back, suppressing; (अम्), n. subduing, suppression;
capture, confinement, prison; defeat, punishment.
